activation wherever it appears. Its strongest responses are to a few groups of words:

* social-conflict and stress vocabulary ("chaos", "havoc", "turmoil", "stress", "abortion",
  "unfair", "absurd") -> positive;
* software and hardware identifiers and API names ("USART", "GPIO", "numpy", "getElementById",
  "readFileSync", "addGap", ".TRAILING") -> negative.

