CANCELLING, ELIMINATING, DESTROYING and ENDING LIVES.

The program reads only the current token's text (lower-cased, leading space dropped) and
predicts how far the unit's output goes negative on that token:
  * -3.0  the Chinese character 消 (消费 consume, 消息 news, 消毒, 消化): the strongest;
  * -2.3  consume / consumer / consumption / consumed, and cancel / cancelled;
          also 耗 and 취소 and Russian потреб- (consumption);
  * -1.2  eliminate / elimination, vanish, disappear, and "beyond";
          also 毁, 灭, 滅 (destroy, extinguish);
  * -0.6  destroy, exhaust, smoke, poison, divorce, gone, extinct, combust, erad-;
  * -0.3  death, kill, murder, suicide, assassin, eat, digest, addict, abort, drown, toxic;
  * -0.2  remove, dispose, delete, waste.
Every other token is predicted at 0. No state is carried between positions.
"""

